---
title: Delivery is independent of document approval
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> pending: notification.enqueued
  pending --> previewed: preview mode only
  pending --> sending: claim outbox lease
  sending --> sent: provider accepted
  sending --> retry_wait: retriable known failure
  sending --> unknown_delivery: timeout after possible acceptance
  retry_wait --> sending: due attempt with same idempotency key
  unknown_delivery --> retry_wait: safe retry established
  sent --> delivered: verified provider webhook
  sent --> bounced: verified provider webhook
  retry_wait --> failed: attempt/time budget exhausted
  pending --> canceled: stale review request
  retry_wait --> canceled: stale review request
  note right of previewed
    Preview demonstrates message content only.
    Real provider delivery remains required.
  end note
  note right of delivered
    Delivery never changes approval state.
    Sending final notice never publishes policy.
    Verified webhooks can also resolve sending,
    retry_wait and unknown_delivery directly.
    Full guards: T09 K-NOTIFY-002.
  end note
